[CENTER]
[SIZE=5][B]🎙️ WHY SMARTLOGIN?[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=3][I]"For almost a decade, server owners have been forced to use legacy authentication plugins conceived in 2015, filled with archaic SHA256 hashes, unoptimized queries, and boring chat-only prompts. We built SmartLogin from scratch to set a new standard in Minecraft server security."[/I][/SIZE]
[/CENTER]

[HR][/HR]

